    "media:imagetext": "your\necret\nsland\nMAY BE CLOSER THAN YOU THINK\nIs there a person who hasn't dreamed of a rendezvous on his own\nsecret island?\nIslands have the climate of dreams. Islands are magic. On an\nisland, you live by the sun and the moon... for the very best\nislands have no clocks.\nSomewhere beneath the Seven Skies you'll find your island.\nSay the secret word. Pan Am's magic will make the sandy beaches,\nrippling waters and whispering palms appear tomorrow.\nIf your budget's to blame for keeping your island secret, use\nPan Am's World-Wide Plan, Go Now-Pay Later.\n• all you need\nis 10% down, up to 20 months to pay the balance. What easier way\nto make an island dream come true?\nKeep it secret no longer! Call your Travel Agent or one of Pan\nAm's 41 offices in the U.S.A. and Canada today!\nLIMITED OFFER: We'll send you a copy of New Horizons*-\nPan Am's 576-page, best selling world travel guide (over half a\nmillion copies sold) -and tell you where this secret island is, if you\nmail Ș1 to Pan American, Dept.158, Box 1111, New York 17, N. Y.\n(In Canada, mail $1 to Pan American, Dept. 162, Box 811, Toronto.)\n•Trade-Mark, Reg. U. 8. Pat. OF\nSECRET ISLANDS ARE THIS CLOSE\ndown паути\nto nearest dallas\n$ 5\nBoston - Bermuda\nNow\nWest Coast- Hawai\nNew York-Majorci\nwest coast-rako rako\nWORLD'S\nMOST\nPAN\nAMERICAN\nEXPERIENCED\nAIRLINE\nHOLIDAY / OCTOBER\nHOLIDAY/OCTOBER",
